    <h2 id="solar">Fara curent la locatie: solar si cartela SIM</h2>
    <p>Singurele care rezolva situatia in care nu ai nici priza, nici internet: teren, livada, casa de vacanta, garaj izolat. Panoul solar incarca un acumulator, iar cartela SIM inlocuieste Wi-Fi-ul.</p>
    {SOLAR.map(x => (
      <div>
        <h3>{x.rol}: {x.short}</h3>
        <ProductCard name={x.p.name.replace(/’/g, "'")} image={x.p.image} price={x.p.price} rating={x.p.rating} reviews={x.p.reviews} badge={x.rol} specs={x.specs} pros={x.pros} cons={x.cons} verdict={x.verdict} outKey={'p-' + x.id} />
      </div>
    ))}

